  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Godes grið is ealra griða selast to geearnianne and geornost to healdanne and þær nehst þæs cynges.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Of all forms of sanctuary, the sanctuary of God is the best to deserve and the most diligently to be held, and next to that, the king’s.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Godes grið is ealra griða selast to geearnianne 7 geornost to healdanne 7 þær nehst þæs cynges.</ab>
      </div>
